# --- Dependencies & Build Folders (모든 하위 폴더 적용) ---
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/bin/
**/out/
**/.vite/
**/.nb-gradle/
**/.vscode/

# --- Gradle Wrapper (필수 파일은 제외) ---
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

# --- Build Exceptions (빌드 파일 내 소스 제외) ---
!**/src/main/**/build/
!**/src/test/**/build/
!**/src/main/**/bin/
!**/src/test/**/bin/
!**/src/main/**/out/
!**/src/test/**/out/

# --- Logs & Env ---
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
.env*

# --- Configuration (보안) ---
src/main/resources/application.properties
src/main/resources/application-*.properties
src/main/resources/application.yml
src/main/resources/application-*.yml